infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Reducer + context vs an external store: the decision rule
  desc Same feature — stay dependency-free, or reach for selectors and devtools
  compares
    - label Reducer + context
      children
        - label Feature-scoped domain
          desc Checkout, editor pane, wizard — not app-wide state
        - label Modest writes, overlapping reads
          desc Most consumers display the same shared slice
        - label Centralized, pure, testable transitions
          desc Replay action sequences in microseconds, no DOM
        - label Zero dependencies
          desc createContext + useReducer; nothing to install
    - label External store (library)
      children
        - label App-wide or write-heavy state
          desc Shared across unrelated subtrees, high write rate
        - label Readers consume disjoint slices
          desc Each subscribes to a different part of the state
        - label Selector-grade subscription precision
          desc Re-render only when the selected slice changes
        - label Devtools history + middleware
          desc Action timeline, time-travel, interceptors
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
